    "description": "Vintage Music Magazine Lot - 2 Pieces\nPeople Weekly & Masters of Rock\n1980 & 1991 Publications\nThis vintage lot features two commemorative rock and roll music publications documenting iconic artists. The December 22, 1980 issue of People Weekly serves as an immediate historical memorial tribute following the tragic passing of John Lennon, depicting Lennon and Yoko Ono on the cover. Accompanying it is the 1991 Masters of Rock Issue 5 dedicated entirely to The Rolling Stones, featuring in-depth band interviews and career retrospectives.\nItems Included:\nPeople Weekly (December 22, 1980) - John Lennon 1940-1980 Tribute memorial issue featuring cover photo with Yoko Ono and period advertisements\nMasters of Rock Issue 5 (1991) - The Rolling Stones special edition featuring exclusive interviews, Brian Jones lookback, and band photography\nClear rigid protective display sleeves included for both issues\nCondition:\nMagazines display minor vintage handling wear along spines and edges consistent with age and storage. Covers retain vibrant color, and interior pages are intact with legible text. Exterior protective plastic toploaders show light surface scuffs.\nTHANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING OUR MISSION!\nIf there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days.\nOur business hours are Monday - Friday  7:00 am to 3:00 pm EST\n**If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so.\n**Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nGoodwill of Western and Northern Connecticut strengthens communities by helping people with disabilities and other disadvantages maximize independence through job training and other support services.",
